            <li audience="GSAR">
               <p id="d932e405" audience="GSAR">
                  <ph props="autonumber" class="- topic/ph ">(c)</ph>
                   The FAR does not apply to leasehold
acquisitions of real property. Where referenced in this part, FAR
provisions have been adopted based on a statutory requirement applicable
to such lease acquisitions or as a matter of policy, including, but
not limited to “Federal agency procurement” as defined at FAR 3.104.</p>
